[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13326.469, "timestamp": "03:42:06", "text": "知道。他妈的。向你袭来。我的天啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13333.91, "timestamp": "03:42:13", "text": "填满一个男孩。杀。如果它不是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13337.83, "timestamp": "03:42:17", "text": "荒凉的地方，像空旷的地方一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13340.95, "timestamp": "03:42:20", "text": "呃，那意味着我来错地方了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13343.67, "timestamp": "03:42:23", "text": "我已经走过那段路了。这是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13345.67, "timestamp": "03:42:25", "text": "像这样拥挤的地方，意味着我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13356.79, "timestamp": "03:42:36", "text": "我的天哪。你用的是机枪吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13358.51, "timestamp": "03:42:38", "text": "多杀。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13378.59, "timestamp": "03:42:58", "text": "所以，它在下面。"}]